==Icelandic==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈsuːpa/|lang=is}}
*: {{rhymes|uːpa|lang=is}}

===Etymology 1===
First attested in the 17th century. Probably at least partially a loanword from {{etyl|gml|is}}.

====Noun====
{{is-noun|f|súpu|súpur}}

# [[soup]]

=====Declension=====
{{is-decl-noun-f-w1|s|ú|p|n=?}}

=====Derived terms=====
* {{l|is|borga alla súpuna}}
* {{l|is|kjötsúpa|gloss=clear soup containing meat}}
* {{l|is|súpukjöt|gloss=meat, especially [[mutton]] for making soup}}
* {{l|is|súpuskál|gloss=(soup) [[tureen]]}}
* {{l|is|súputeningur|gloss=[[soup cube]], [[bouillon cube]]}}
* {{l|is|uxahalasúpa|gloss=[[oxtail soup]]}}

=====See also=====
* [[soð]]
* [[vellingur]]

===Etymology 2===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|súpa|lang=non}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|is}} {{term/t|gem-pro|*sūpaną}}.

====Verb====
{{is-verb-strong|saup|supu|sopið}}

# to [[sip]], [[drink]]

=====Conjugation=====
{{is-conj-s2|s|ú|p|mp=-}}

=====Derived terms=====
* {{l|is|ekki er sopið kálið fyrr en í ausuna er komið}}
* {{l|is|súpa á}}
* {{l|is|súpa hveljur}}
* {{l|is|súpa seyðið af}}

